/**
 * Generated light sprites, inlined as data URIs.
 *
 * Art direction from the image-prompt style library (brand-identity-package for the
 * star, ui-screenshot-system for the interface context); shapes rendered by
 * dsh-image-gen (gpt-image-2) with prompts that forbid text.
 *
 * **Shape comes from the model, colour comes from code.** Both sprites are converted
 * to premultiplied alpha with a crushed noise floor, and the wide bloom is then
 * re-coloured through a fixed cyan ramp: the generated bloom carried a muddy warm band
 * that read as a smear at button size, and a ramped palette is also the only way to
 * keep the glow clean on both light and dark themes.
 *
 * Neither sprite is ever placed under the label - see styles.ts for the layer order
 * and scripts/button-harness.mjs for the machine check of that guarantee.
 *
 * @module dsh-improve-prompt/client/assets
 */

